{
  "name": "Kiro Claude Sonnet 4.5 - Chat Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Kiro Claude Sonnet 4.5 Workflow\n\nCe workflow démontre l'utilisation de Kiro CLI avec Claude Sonnet 4.5 via l'endpoint OpenAI-compatible.\n\n### Configuration requise:\n1. Serveur AionUI démarré sur http://localhost:25810\n2. Kiro CLI installé et authentifié\n3. KIRO_CLI_ENABLED=true dans .env\n\n### Endpoints disponibles:\n- Chat: http://localhost:25810/v1/kiro-cli/chat/completions\n- Models: http://localhost:25810/v1/kiro-cli/models\n- Status: http://localhost:25810/api/kiro-cli/status",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 567
      },
      "id": "note-1",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [240, 240],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "Explique-moi les closures en JavaScript en 3 phrases."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-prompt",
      "name": "Set Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [460, 460],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://localhost:25810/v1/kiro-cli/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
